This is Eleventy.js project with the following structure :

- src/
    - _includes/  - .njk templates (base + inheritors)
    - css/        - single `styles.css` containing all css
    - js/         - single `scripts.js` containing all javascript
    - notes/      - folders by category, each contains .md pages (and maybe subcategories)
        - python/
    - reviews/
        - anime/
        - philosophy/
    - `index.md`  - home page

- `.eleventy.js`  - eleventy thingies (collections, filters, structures etc.)
- `package.json`  - npm config
